pan> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List\">List</a> (<span class=\"fn\">α</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">start </span><span class=\"fn\">len</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">o</span>.<a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Radix.html#MPN.NatOps.IsPowsZ\">IsPowsZ</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">ps</span></span> →\n  <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">start</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">len</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">l</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List.length\">length</a></span> →\n    <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">len</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HPow.hPow\">^</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">ps</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List.length\">length</a></span> → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">o</span>.<a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Ops.html#MPN.NatOps.val\">val</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">o</span>.<a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Radix.html#MPN.NatOps.decVal\">decVal</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">rbase</span> <span class=\"fn\">D</span> <span class=\"fn\">ps</span> <span class=\"fn\">start</span> <span class=\"fn\">len</span>)</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Nat/ToString.html#Nat.ofDigitChars\">Nat.ofDigitChars</a> <span class=\"fn\">10</span> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Radix.html#MPN.NatOps.chars\">chars</a> <span class=\"fn\">l</span> <span class=\"fn\">start</span> <span class=\"fn\">len</span>)</span> <span class=\"fn\">0</span></span></span></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./MPN/Generic/Radix.html#MPN.NatOps.decVal_spec","kind":"theorem","line":407,"name":"MPN.NatOps.decVal_spec","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN/Generic/Radix.lean#L407-L438"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/Generic/Radix.html#MPN.NatOps.fromDec\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">NatOps</span>.<span class=\"name\">fromDec</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">o</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Ops.html#MPN.NatOps\">NatOps</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">rbase</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> → <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">D </span><span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\">α</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The value of `n` decimal digits, `rbase` reading `len` of them from `start`.","docLink":"./MPN/Generic/Radix.html#MPN.NatOps.fromDec","kind":"def","line":389,"name":"MPN.NatOps.fromDec","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN/Generic/Radix.lean#L389-L391"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/Generic/Radix.html#MPN.NatOps.decVal\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">NatOps</span>.<span class=\"name\">decVal</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">o</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Ops.html#MPN.NatOps\">NatOps</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">rbase</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> → <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">D</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List\">List</a> (<span class=\"fn\">α</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> → <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The value of the `len ≤ 2ᵏ` digits from `start`, for the powers `ps` below `10^(2ᵏ)`: the high\ndigits times the top power plus the low `2ᵏ⁻¹` digits, recursively, and `rbase` for `D` digits or\nfewer. The product by `p' Bᶻ` is the product by `p'`, shifted by `z` limbs.","docLink":"./MPN/Generic/Radix.html#MPN.NatOps.decVal","kind":"def","line":374,"name":"MPN.NatOps.decVal","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN/Generic/Radix.lean#L374-L387"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/Generic/Radix.html#MPN.NatOps.isPowsZ_powsZ\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">NatOps</span>.<span class=\"name\">isPowsZ_powsZ</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">o</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Ops.html#MPN.NatOps\">NatOps</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">k</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">o</span>.<a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Radix.html#MPN.NatOps.IsPowsZ\">IsPowsZ</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">o</span>.<a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Radix.html#MPN.NatOps.powsZ\">powsZ</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">k</span>)</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#And\">∧</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">o</span>.<a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Radix.html#MPN.NatOps.powsZ\">powsZ</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">k</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List.length\">length</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">k</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./MPN/Generic/Radix.html#MPN.NatOps.isPowsZ_powsZ","kind":"theorem","line":354,"name":"MPN.NatOps.isPowsZ_powsZ","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN/Generic/Radix.lean#L354-L370"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/Generic/Radix.html#MPN.NatOps.powsZ\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">NatOps</span>.<span class=\"name\">powsZ</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">o</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Ops.html#MPN.NatOps\">NatOps</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List\">List</a> (<span class=\"fn\">α</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The powers `10^(2ʲ)` for `j` from `k - 1` down to `0`, by squares, each without as many zero low\nlimbs as it has: `10^(2ʲ)` ends with `2ʲ` zero bits, so with `2ʲ / log₂ B` zero limbs at base\n`B = 2ʷ`, which a check confirms.","docLink":"./MPN/Generic/Radix.html#MPN.NatOps.powsZ","kind":"def","line":340,"name":"MPN.NatOps.powsZ","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN/Generic/Radix.lean#L340-L352"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/Generic/Radix.html#MPN.NatOps.stripLo\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">NatOps</span>.<span class=\"name\">stripLo</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">o</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Ops.html#MPN.NatOps\">NatOps</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_ar